_:b187_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Architecture: the event references identifiers by URI — GTIN in epcList, GLN in readPoint/bizLocation, party GLN in source/destination. Model-, location-, and party-level master data is served by the GS1 Digital Link / Web Vocabulary resolver when those URIs are dereferenced; it is NOT embedded in the event." .
_:b187_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "GS1 demo prefix 952 (7-digit GCP: 9521234)." .
_:b187_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "HTTP header: GS1-Extensions: oec=https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/common/core/, euppwr=https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/eu/ppwr/" .
_:b187_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "PPWR commissioning event: a production lot of the beverage-bottle trade item (see examples/beverage-bottle-lot-01.jsonld) enters the regulated supply chain. The lot is class-level (AI 01 + AI 10), so it travels in quantityList, not epcList." .
_:b187_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "gs1:masterDataAvailableFor carries ONLY item/lot-level master data (e.g. countryOfOrigin, regulatoryInformation, harvestDate, EUDR plot geolocation). ilmd carries lot/instance data of the items this event creates. Observation extensions sit at event level." .
_:b187_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "2.0" .
